              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:1"
              ],
              "start": 0,
              "end": 63,
              "quote": "我和你一样，每天只有24小时，但我作了具体选择，使自己每天都能充分利用时间，并仍然快乐轻松。也许这些建议能帮助你充分利用时间。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-2",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:2"
              ],
              "start": 65,
              "end": 72,
              "quote": "挑最重要的事。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-3",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:3"
              ],
              "start": 74,
              "end": 157,
              "quote": "对生活中有意义的事作出选择。把时间用在你觉得有趣且有成效的事情上。我选择当顾问，因为我喜欢与公司合作，却不想过大公司首席执行官的生活。我的选择基于自己想要的生活方式。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-4",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:4"
              ],
              "start": 159,
              "end": 167,
              "quote": "把活动结合起来。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-5",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:5"
              ],
              "start": 169,
              "end": 264,
              "quote": "许多人为了兼顾朋友、家人、工作和娱乐等而苦恼。别再试图在它们之间一一平衡时间。寻找把这些事结合起来享受的方法。围绕工作环境中的人建立社交生活，寻找志趣相投的同事，围绕你爱的人和活动发展事业。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-6",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:6"
              ],
              "start": 266,
              "end": 274,
              "quote": "做主动的学习者。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-7",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:7"
              ],
              "start": 276,
              "end": 345,
              "quote": "你也许认为学习会占更多时间，但实际上总有新方法可以节省日常事务的时间，让你腾出精力做最重要的事。始终寻找能在这里或那里省回一小时的新办法。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-8",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:8"
              ],
              "start": 347,
              "end": 351,
              "quote": "放轻松。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-9",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:9"
              ],
              "start": 353,
              "end": 433,
              "quote": "多数情况下，几件事没做完并不会让世界末日到来。庆祝进步，不断改进，让生活快乐而有成效。这就是为什么各类效率手册都重视列清单。每完成一件事都是小小胜利，积少成多。"
            }
          ]
        },
        "completedSourceTexts": [
          {
            "textId": "completed-block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:1",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:1",
            "text": "I have the same 24 hours in a day as you do, but I have made specific choices that allow me to make the most of every day and still feel happy and relaxed. Perhaps these tips will help you make the most of your time."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed-block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:3",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:3",
            "text": "Make choices about what is meaningful in your life. Focus on spending time that for you is fun and productive. I chose the life of an adviser because I like to work with companies, but don’t want the life of a big company CEO. My choices are based on the lifestyle I want."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed-block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:5",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:5",
            "text": "Many people go crazy trying to figure out how to spend time with friends, family, work, play, etc. Stop trying to balance time between them all. Find ways to enjoy them in a combined manner. Build your social life around people in your work environment. Find people in your company who share common interests and develop your career (职业) around the people and activities you love."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed-block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:6",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:6",
            "text": "Be an active learner."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed-block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:9",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:9",
            "text": "The world won’t come to an end in most cases just because you left a few things undone. Celebrate progress and keep refining（改进）toward a happy productive existence. This is why making lists is important in any productivity handbook. Every completion is a small victory that adds up in a big way."
          }
        ],
