                "quote": "Find people in your company who share common interests and develop your career (职业) around the people and activities you love.",
                "start": 215,
                "end": 341
              }
            ],
            "translationRanges": [
              {
                "textId": "translation-group:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices",
                "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-5",
                "quote": "寻找志趣相投的同事，围绕你爱的人和活动发展事业。",
                "start": 71,
                "end": 95
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "discourseStructure": {
        "summary": "首段用作者自己的做法引出“这些建议”，后面四块各由一句短小标题领起、一段话展开：先讲取舍，再讲合并，再讲学习省时，最后讲放下未完成的事、看重积累。",
        "units": [
          {
            "unitId": "seven-unit-1",
            "heading": "引出建议",
            "paragraphIds": [
              "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:1"
            ],
            "summary": "作者同样只有24小时，靠具体的选择每天过得充实又轻松，由此引出下面几条建议。"
          },
          {
            "unitId": "seven-unit-2",
            "heading": "挑最重要的事",
            "paragraphIds": [
              "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:2",
              "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:3"
            ],
            "summary": "按自己想要的生活方式做选择，用作者选做顾问、不做大公司总裁的经历作例子。"
          },
          {
            "unitId": "seven-unit-3",
            "heading": "把活动合在一起",
            "paragraphIds": [
              "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:4",
              "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:5"
            ],
            "summary": "不必在朋友、家人、工作、娱乐之间来回平衡，而是围绕工作圈子建立社交，把爱好和事业结合。"
          },
          {
            "unitId": "seven-unit-4",
            "heading": "做主动的学习者",
            "paragraphIds": [
              "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:6",
              "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:7"
            ],
            "summary": "学习看似费时，其实新方法能省下日常事务的时间，所以要一直找省时的新办法。"
          },
          {
            "unitId": "seven-unit-5",
            "heading": "放轻松",
            "paragraphIds": [
              "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:8",
              "block:paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:9"
            ],
            "summary": "几件事没做完天不会塌，要庆祝进步；列清单让每完成一项都成为一次小胜利。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "extraOptions": {
